HedgeGuard invariants
├── remaining size never increases except through the hedger's setTarget
├── no fill in the wrong direction ever succeeds
├── no fill above the remaining size ever succeeds
└── remaining size never exceeds the last size the hedger authorized

HedgeGuard through the official SwapVM router
├── when the taker swaps USDC for WBTC against a MakerSellsBtc target
│   └── it should quote exactly what the swap delivers and move real tokens
├── when the taker swaps WBTC for USDC against a MakerSellsBtc target
│   └── it should revert with WrongDirection and move nothing
├── when the swap is larger than the remaining target
│   └── it should revert with SizeExceedsRemaining
└── when the hedger clears the target between quote and swap
    └── it should revert with TargetNotSet
